    documentation: ['Nevis LLC formation and operating agreement', 'Trust deed (if owned by a trust) with duress clause', 'Registered agent and trustee engagements', 'Solvency affidavit at funding', 'US Forms 8858/8865, 3520/3520-A, FBAR, 8938'],
